      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "REBORN PASSION (3) finished in the minors last time but the start prior broke the clock when winning over 400m at this track, taking a Maiden in a swift 22.91. Can measure up on top win two back. ZIPPING NICK (4) is progressing well with another good run, placing by one length (23.34) in a Grade 5 at this track. Good beginner but will need a little luck from a middle draw. Bold showing expected. ZIPPING AMOS (5) doesn't win out of turn but recent form sound. Has finished in the placings two on end now, the latest when third (17.89) at Taree Super Track. Safe beginner but has a tricky box to overcome. Well-placed to take this out. ACE TEN (1) can run a bold race on best form.",
